    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299340/extras/2c888f54c15e84ff94afdbbbda4630ff.poster.avif?t=1750502580\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299340/extras/2c888f54c15e84ff94afdbbbda4630ff.webm?t=1750502580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299340/extras/2c888f54c15e84ff94afdbbbda4630ff.mp4?t=1750502580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You are a sausage dog. You must solve puzzles and uncover the ancient wisdom of your ancestors. Only through stretching yourself to infinity may you discover deep truth. Only through deep truth may you grow.<br><br>Do not cease from exploration.<br><br><i>Sausage Dog Tends To Infinity</i> is a single-player 3D Sokoban-like puzzle game, in which you are an infinitely-stretching sausage dog who must solve puzzles to uncover hidden wisdom and find the answers to the world's deepest mysteries. Expand yourself across 32 unique challenging levels, each revealing another cryptic clue.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299340/extras/2c888f54c15e84ff94afdbbbda4630ff.poster.avif?t=1750502580\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299340/extras/2c888f54c15e84ff94afdbbbda4630ff.webm?t=1750502580\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299340/extras/2c888f54c15e84ff94afdbbbda4630ff.mp4?t=1750502580\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You are a sausage dog. You must solve puzzles and uncover the ancient wisdom of your ancestors. Only through stretching yourself to infinity may you discover deep truth. Only through deep truth may you grow.<br><br>Do not cease from exploration.<br><br><i>Sausage Dog Tends To Infinity</i> is a single-player 3D Sokoban-like puzzle game, in which you are an infinitely-stretching sausage dog who must solve puzzles to uncover hidden wisdom and find the answers to the world's deepest mysteries. Expand yourself across 32 unique challenging levels, each revealing another cryptic clue.",
    "short_description": "Sausage Dog Tends To Infinity is a classic Sokoban-like 3D puzzle game in which you must stretch yourself to infinity to solve puzzles and uncover ancient wisdom. Learn and grow as you explore a deserted world and discover the answers to questions you have yet to ask.",
